@startuml F1.20-D02-dar-ciencia
title F1.20-D02 — Dar ciência
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Aluno" as Aluno
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "ServiceRecordController" as Ctrl
participant "AcknowledgeUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Aluno -> WebApp: Estou ciente
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /atendimentos/{id}/acknowledge
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: UPDATE CIENCIA_DADA\n+ audit_log (IP)
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
UC --> Ctrl: ok
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200\n(sem _links.acknowledge)
WebApp --> Aluno: badge Ciente

@enduml
